   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "Clothing",
   "texto": [
    "**Gömlek** = shirt; **pantolon** = pants; **elbise** = dress. Clothing names are normally used in singular for a garment.",
    "**Bu gömleği alıyorum** = I buy this shirt. The defined object receives **-(y)ı/-i/-u/-ü**: **gömlek → gömleği**. If it ends in vowel, **y**: **çantayı** (the bag) appears.",
    "The suffix is not necessary when talking about something indefinite: **Bir gömlek alıyorum** = I buy a shirt."
   ]
